# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A control override retunes a base: the starfield pushed to warp. On top,
# four sprites each running at their own rate — a planet, a rocket whose
# exhaust flickers at 12 fps (bobbing on a keyframe track), and two little
# aliens, one mirrored by flags 3, waving at 2 and 3. Designed at 32x32
# (`U`), so the crew fills any panel.
S - Space Cadet
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Warp
I @pat/starfield-2d
C sliderWarpPercent 5242880
L sprite 17 2 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Planet
I @spr/planet
L sprite 7 4 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Rocket
I @spr/rocket
M 0    = =   = sine
M 1500 = 6   = sine
M 3000 = =   = sine
L sprite 19 22 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Alien
I @spr/pixel-alien
L sprite 1 23 0 0 normal 100 none fill 3
N Alien 2
I @spr/pixel-alien
A 3
